languages/sample.tsx:1:13: personified-verb: "The view" is not a person or a program and cannot "decide"; make the program or person that acts the subject, or use a verb such as "holds", "marks", "declares" or "determines"
languages/sample.tsx:2:48: personified-verb: "The page" is not a person or a program and cannot "want"; make the program or person that acts the subject, or use a verb such as "holds", "marks", "declares" or "determines"
